    <div class="trick-block"><div class="ans-label">Memory Trick</div><strong>"P F S L C F A B"</strong> → Plasticizers, Fillers, Stabilizers, Lubricants, Colorants, Flame retardants, Antioxidants, Blowing agents</div>
