    <div class="kw-block"><div class="ans-label">Keywords</div>Correlation coefficient, Pearson's coefficient, least squares method, independent variable, dependent variable, Y = a + bX, cause and effect, symmetric, linear relationship</div>
    <div class="trick-block"><div class="ans-label">Memory Trick</div>"Correlation = Connection (strength). Regression = Reason (cause-effect)." Correlation is symmetric (both ways), Regression is one-way (X predicts Y).</div>
